[0.000, "o", "100H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mDecisions to confirm\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[78X\r\n  - Quantity is printed only, not stored. Since you said no schema change, the 2 exists only in that\r\n    run's output, and the table row can't show it. If you want it persisted, that needs a migration \r\n    adding a \u001b[94mquantity\u001b[39m column.\u001b[71X\r\n  - The changes are uncommitted in the worktree.\u001b[52X\u001b[43;100H\u001b[1K\u001b[91m\r\n·\u001b[39m \u001b[91mB\u001b[93mrew\u001b[91ming… \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m\u001b[2m(29s · ↓\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37m\u001b[2m3.9k tokens)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[68X\u001b[47;104H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
